  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Chameleon** (2 other sources): Chameleon is played inside Doin' Something, which is segued in before it and again after it; Chameleon is segued into from Doin' Something and then back into Doin' Something [1][2]\n- **Hurry Up And Wait** (1 other source): The slot between Bridge to Bama and Uncle Junior is listed as an untitled piece in these notes [2]\n- **Jesus Children Of America** (1 other source): Jesus Children flows directly into Who Knows, with the two songs joined by a segue [1]\n- **Turn It Out** (1 other source): Turn It Out is marked as the encore, closing the show after Cannonball [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2000-07-09.shnf** (recommended): soundboard; 13 songs; 87 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **soulive2000-07-09**: audience recording; 1 songs; 95 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The reviewer was at this festival and also attended earlier years; they describe the performances as small and intimate [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2000-07-09.shnf**: taped by ?; transferred by ?; source: SBD -> D7 [1]\n- **soulive2000-07-09**: taped by Michael Tierney; transferred by Michael Tierney; source: AUD>DAT [2]",
